Each of the above determinations is filed with the application record for the affected site and is binding for
that site only. The pattern reflected in these three closures does not select a controlling document across
the program: DIS-01 §5 Table 5-1 and DPS-07 §4.2 each remain in force as issued, and each new site
presenting a comparable question is referred under §3 and determined on its own protection scheme.
End of ERP-9 Rev 2 — Engineering Referral Procedure.